Sea Defender: controls
======================

Mouse          aim (the cross-hair)
Left button    fire a missile from the left ship at the cross-hair
Right button   fire a missile from the right ship
P              pause, and P again to go on
Esc            back to the menu
Cursor keys    move in the menus; Return chooses
Alt + F4       quit at once (or Quit in the menu)

A new high score asks for your name: type it, Backspace to rub out,
Return to keep it. High scores go to sea.hsc and the settings to sea.cfg,
both in the game's drawer.
